spread sexual disruption in wild fish populations</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>114</volume><issue>suppl 1</issue><fpage>32</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16818244</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b23-ehp0114s1-000147"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Jobling</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheahan</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Osborne</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Matthiessen</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sumpter</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1996</year><article-title>Inhibition of testicular growth in rainbow trout (<italic>Oncorhynchus mykiss</italic>) exposed to estrogenic alkylphenolic chemicals</article-title><source>Environ Toxicol Chem</source><volume>15</volume><fpage>194</fpage><lpage>202</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b24-ehp0114s1-000147"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Jobling</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nolan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tyler</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Brighty</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Sumpter</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Widespread sexual disruption in wild fish</article-title><source>Environ Sci Technol</source><volume>32</volume><fpage>2498</fpage><lpage>2506</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b25-ehp0114s1-000147"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Jobling</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Coey</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitmore</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kime</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name>